    "notes":  "**The guided videos are offered where you are already stuck.** An empty state - \"No closed trades yet\", \"No open positions\", \"No orders yet\" - now offers that screen\u0027s own tour, with its real length beside it. It is the moment you least know what a screen will show you, and until now nothing on it said a twenty-second walk existed.\n\n**It never shows a dead link.** When no video is mapped to a screen, nothing renders at all - so a screen can carry the offer before the video exists and light up on the day it lands, with no app update. And a length is only printed when it was actually measured, never estimated.",
